@startuml
title CMTAT Beacon Factory - one shared beacon, many proxies

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam NoteFontSize 11

component "CMTAT_BEACON_FACTORY\n<size:10>AccessControl - CREATE2</size>" as Factory #EEF5FF

component "UpgradeableBeacon\n<size:10>owner: beaconOwner</size>" as Beacon #FFF6E5

component "BeaconProxy\n<size:10>CMTAT token #1</size>" as Proxy1 #F3F3F3
component "BeaconProxy\n<size:10>CMTAT token #2</size>" as Proxy2 #F3F3F3

component "CMTATStandardUpgradeable\n<size:10>implementation V1</size>" as ImplV1 #EAF7EE
component "CMTATStandardUpgradeable\n<size:10>implementation V2</size>" as ImplV2 #FDEEEE

Factory ..> Beacon : creates once in constructor
Factory --> Proxy1 : deployCMTAT()
Factory --> Proxy2 : deployCMTAT()

Proxy1 --> Beacon : implementation()
Proxy2 --> Beacon : implementation()

Beacon --> ImplV1 : delegatecall target
Beacon ..> ImplV2 : upgradeTo() moves\nEVERY proxy at once

note bottom of ImplV2
  All proxies share one beacon, so a single
  upgradeTo() call migrates every deployed
  CMTAT token in one transaction.
end note

@enduml
